# Files the iyi port refuses in the declarations pass, with why: <repo-relative file> <reason>.
# The gate fails a file the port refuses unless it is listed here, and fails a listed file the port no
# longer refuses (remove its row then). A listed file counts the 0 its floor row holds.
#
# The LLVM bridge declares `lib ::LibLLVM` inside one `{% begin %}` block. The port's macro engine stops at
# `StringLiteral#strip` ("macro method 'StringLiteral#strip' is not ported", bench/selfhost_macros_exercise
# --sites src/compiler/llvm/lib_llvm.iyi), so the lib is never declared and every file that names a LibLLVM type
# is refused with "undefined constant LibLLVM::<Type>".
src/compiler/backend/llvm/emit.iyi the LibLLVM lib is not declared: the macro engine does not port StringLiteral#strip
src/compiler/backend/llvm/import.iyi the LibLLVM lib is not declared: the macro engine does not port StringLiteral#strip
src/compiler/backend/llvm/translate.iyi the LibLLVM lib is not declared: the macro engine does not port StringLiteral#strip
src/compiler/llvm.iyi the LibLLVM lib is not declared: the macro engine does not port StringLiteral#strip
src/compiler/llvm/builder.iyi the LibLLVM lib is not declared: the macro engine does not port StringLiteral#strip
src/compiler/llvm/context.iyi the LibLLVM lib is not declared: the macro engine does not port StringLiteral#strip
src/compiler/llvm/llvm.iyi the LibLLVM lib is not declared: the macro engine does not port StringLiteral#strip
src/compiler/llvm/memory_buffer.iyi the LibLLVM lib is not declared: the macro engine does not port StringLiteral#strip
src/compiler/llvm/module.iyi the LibLLVM lib is not declared: the macro engine does not port StringLiteral#strip
src/compiler/llvm/pass_manager.iyi the LibLLVM lib is not declared: the macro engine does not port StringLiteral#strip
src/compiler/llvm/target.iyi the LibLLVM lib is not declared: the macro engine does not port StringLiteral#strip
src/compiler/llvm/values.iyi the LibLLVM lib is not declared: the macro engine does not port StringLiteral#strip
src/compiler/tools/ir.iyi the LibLLVM lib is not declared: the macro engine does not port StringLiteral#strip
# The port binds explicit import names but does not bind `::*` names. Hosted
# UsingDecl resolves the imported unit's public names and rejects ambiguity at use.
samples/iyi/derive.iyi undefined constant Name: import std/derives::* does not bind Std::Derives::Name for Tag#@label
samples/iyi/modules.iyi undefined constant Greet: import app/greeter::* does not bind App::Greeter::Greet for impl Greet for User
